msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Taiga「Shall we take a little break? I want＿some hot tea.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Tomamos un pequeño descanso? Quiero＿un poco de té caliente.」"

msgid "Ami「Ami-chan does too～」"
msgstr "Ami「Ami-chan también～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, then come on in.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, entonces pasen.」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji, make mine milk tea.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ryuuji, el mío que sea té con leche.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You got it. Take a seat and wait. Want＿the same thing, Kawashima?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Claro. Siéntense y esperen. ¿Quieres＿lo mismo, Kawashima?」"

msgid "Ami「Anything's fine as long as it's, like,＿hot～ ① Gosh, it's freezing outside......」"
msgstr "Ami「Cualquier cosa me sirve mientras＿esté, o sea, caliente～ ① Ay, hace＿muchísimo frío afuera......」"

msgid "Ami「......Ugggh!! My fingers are all dried out!＿No no no! Takasu-kun, where do you＿keep the lotion!?」"
msgstr "Ami「......¡¡Agggh!! ¡Tengo los dedos muy＿resecos! ¡No, no, no! Takasu-kun,＿¡¿dónde guardas la crema?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey, Kawashima! It's fine to hang out＿here but we have to be quieter......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Oye, Kawashima! Está bien pasar＿el rato aquí, pero hay que hablar＿más bajo......」"

msgid "Yasuko「Ryu......u......chaaan......」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Ryu......u......chaaan......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「See what you've done!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Mira lo que hiciste!」"

msgid "Ami「Oh, I'm sorry!」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Ay, lo siento!」"

msgid "Yasuko「Ami......tan......?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Ami......tan......?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yacchan, did we wake you? We're＿sorry. I'll make sure to teach StuChi a＿lesson.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Yacchan, ¿te despertamos? Lo＿sentimos. Me encargaré de darle＿una lección a StuChi.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Nnnyaah～ Taiga-chaaan...... What time＿is ittt......?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Nnnyaah～ Taiga-chaaan......＿¿Qué hora esss......?」"

msgid "Taiga「It's a little past noon.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ya pasó un poco del mediodía.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Time to get uppp......」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Hora de levantarseee......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Will you be alright? Did you get＿enough sleep?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Estarás bien? ¿Dormiste lo suficiente?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Yup...... Hmm? Huh?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Sip...... ¿Mmm? ¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's up?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Ryuu-channn...... looks maddd......」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Ryuu-channn...... parece enojadooo......」"

msgid "Both「Pfft!」"
msgstr "Ambas「¡Pfft!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I was born this way!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¡Así nací yo!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Up to no good? Nothing comes to＿mind......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Tramando algo malo? No se＿me ocurre nada......」"

msgid "Yasuko「Reallyyy? But your eyes say you're＿thinking of bad thiiings～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿De verdaaad? Pero tus ojos dicen＿que piensas en cosas malaaas～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Bad things?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Cosas malas?」"

msgid "Ami「M-O-M-M-Y①」"
msgstr "Ami「M-A-M-I①」"

msgid "Yasuko「Kyaaan! Ami-chaaan①」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¡Kyaaan! Ami-chaaan①」"

msgid "Ami「He's not \"up to no good\"～ Takasu-kun＿is about to do something, like, SUPER＿selfless. He's going to play Cupid①」"
msgstr "Ami「No está \"tramando nada malo\"～ Takasu-kun＿va a hacer algo, o sea, SÚPER＿desinteresado. Va a hacer de Cupido①」"

msgid "Yasuko「Golly gosh, she called Yacchan＿mommyyy☆」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Caramba, llamó a Yacchan mamiii☆」"

msgid "Ami「OUCH!!」"
msgstr "Ami「¡¡AUCH!!」"

msgid "Yasuko「Help someoneee～?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Ayudar a alguieeen～?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yes. It's a crucial plan to save a little＿lamb lost in the darkness.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí. Es un plan crucial para salvar a una＿ovejita perdida en la oscuridad.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Is that sooo......? Hmmm, kinda＿confusing, but be extra careful in the＿dark～ Here, you can have this～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿De verdaaad......? Mmm, es algo＿confuso, pero tengan mucho cuidado en＿lo oscuro～ Tomen, quédense con esto～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（A flashlight...... I feel like she's thinking＿of a different kind of \"darkness\", but oh＿well.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Una linterna...... Siento que＿está pensando en otro tipo de＿\"oscuridad\", pero en fin.）」"

msgid "Ami「I've had enough of this running gag.＿What if all your kicking leaves bruises＿on me?! Grr!」"
msgstr "Ami「Ya tuve suficiente de este chiste＿repetido. ¡¿Y si de tanto patearme＿me dejas moretones?! ¡Grr!」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji, hurry up with the tea.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ryuuji, apúrate con el té.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, wait just a little longer. Want some,＿Yasuko?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, espera un poco más. ¿Quieres＿un poco, Yasuko?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Do wanttt～ Listen, Ryuu-chan.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Sí quierooo～ Escucha, Ryuu-chan.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hm?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Mmm?」"

msgid "Yasuko「If someone tries to meddle with your＿love life, kick them in the llama and＿send them flying☆」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Si alguien intenta meterse en＿tu vida amorosa, patéalo en la＿llama y mándalo a volar☆」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Eek......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Hii......」"

msgid "Both「......」"
msgstr "Ambas「......」"

msgid "Yasuko「......Have you heard of that saying?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「......¿Habías oído ese dicho?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Never. And I think you made a＿couple mistakes there.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Nunca. Y creo que cometiste＿un par de errores ahí.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Ehe ☆ Maybeee～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Eje ☆ Tal veeez～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「For your information, I'm not meddling＿with anyone's love life. I'm supporting＿it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Para que lo sepas, no me meto＿en la vida amorosa de nadie.＿La estoy apoyando.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Ohh～ Reallyyy?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Ahh～ ¿De verdaaad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（It's true...... right?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Es verdad...... ¿no?）」"

msgid "Yasuko「Nuh uhhh～ Yacchan loooves＿Ryuu-chan's eyes. But this time's＿different......」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Nopeee～ A Yacchan le encaaantan＿los ojos de Ryuu-chan. Pero esta＿vez es diferente......」"

msgid "Yasuko「Ryuu-chan, are you up to no gooddd?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Ryuu-chan, ¿estás tramando algo malooo?」"

msgid "Ami「Oh, I'm sorry, that was forward of me. It＿wasn't on purpose～ Dumb ol'＿Ami-chan. It just came naturally to」"
msgstr "Ami「Ay, perdón, qué atrevida. No fue＿a propósito～ Tonta Ami-chan. Solo＿me salió natural a」"

msgid "Ami「m......」"
msgstr "Ami「m......」"

msgid "Taiga「Yacchan, don't worry. Ryuuji may look＿like a criminal, but he'd never do＿anything bad.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Yacchan, no te preocupes. Aunque＿Ryuuji parezca un criminal, nunca＿haría nada malo.」"

msgid "Taiga「We're just formulating a plan to try and＿seriously help someone.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Solo estamos ideando un plan para＿intentar ayudar en serio a alguien.」"
